release.body:
Ten interactive frame-chain proofs built in ten isolated Git worktrees and merged without squashing any frame commit.

Live catalog: https://kody-w.github.io/frame-chains/showcase/

The release includes:
- ten standalone synthetic HTML worlds;
- a machine-readable merge ledger binding every final frame branch head;
- explicit per-frame positive and failure oracles;
- six gate-mutation probes proving the acceptance gate can turn red;
- light/dark contrast, mobile CTA, 44px target, reset, prompt-copy, privacy, and cross-browser checks.

No PII, private IP addresses, local paths, credentials, private hostnames, or proprietary estate data are included.
